  "description": "A lightweight templating engine for generating code and text files from C# templates, directly within the VSCode editor.\n      Templates are pure C# code, compiled and executed on demand using Roslyn compiler services. There is no need to learn a \n      custom template language or embed template directives in the code. Output can be C# code, HTML, XML, JSON, or any other \n      text-based format. \n      HoofMark.CSharpTemplating.Cli is the command-line interface for running templates, packaged as a .NET tool\n      and invoked by the VSCode cstemplate extension.",
